{"id":"n23712-1-7","stage":5,"title":"건수 · 件数","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23712-1-7-1","ko":"이번 달에 보너스 받았다며?","zh":"听说你这个月领到奖金了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달에","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보너스","meaning":"奖金","explanation":"보너스：奖金","readings":[{"term":"보너스","audio":"/audio/1e6c6086110c570346c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14490","senseId":"1","lemma":"보너스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받았다며?","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"1e6c6086110c5703","term":"보너스","zh":"奖金","audio":"/audio/1e6c6086110c570346c7.mp3","entryId":"14490","definition":"定期工资以外按照业绩或贡献度而额外获得的奖励的钱。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收到 ，得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"拿到他人给的或送来的东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/cb9804ada062fdfe8197.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23712-1-7-2","ko":"내가 판매 건수가 제일 높은 사원으로 뽑혔대.","zh":"据说我被选为销售业绩最高的员工呢。","note":"点不懂的词，